{"sha": "9eb3e79a9557f2aaf87365f4bcc691b7df7c5967c55502545fa1b6c77598b341", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.0]", "  % neutron -> proton beta decay quark diagram", "  % three quark lines left to right", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (0,2.0) -- (7.2,2.0);", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (0,1.45) -- (7.2,1.45);", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (0,0.9) -- (3.3,0.9);", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] (3.3,0.9) -- (7.2,0.9);", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\scriptsize, anchor=east] at (-0.1,2.0) {u};", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\scriptsize, anchor=east] at (-0.1,1.45) {d};", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\scriptsize, anchor=east] at (-0.1,0.9) {d};", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (7.3,0.9) {u};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (7.3,1.45) {d};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (7.3,2.0) {u};", "  % W boson wavy-ish (zigzag)", "  \\draw[omExo, thick] (3.3,0.9)", "    -- (3.75,0.55) -- (4.05,0.75) -- (4.35,0.35) -- (4.65,0.55)", "    -- (4.95,0.15) -- (5.25,0.35) -- (5.55,-0.05);", "  \\node[omExo, font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (4.75,0.72) {W$^-$};", "  % electron and antineutrino", "  \\draw[thick] (5.55,-0.05) -- (7.2,0.25);", "  \\draw[thick] (5.55,-0.05) -- (7.2,-0.55);", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (7.3,0.25) {e$^-$};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (7.3,-0.55) {$\\bar\\nu_{\\text{e}}$};", "  % braces labels", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=east] at (-0.75,1.45) {中子};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (8.35,1.45) {质子};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small $\\beta$ 衰变，放大到夸克层次：一个 d 夸克", "通过发射一个虚的 W$^-$ 变为 u 夸克，它随即物化为", "电子加反中微子。各项守恒：电荷", "$-\\tfrac13 = +\\tfrac23 - 1 + 0$，重子数，轻子数。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{粒子的制造与观测}", "", "\\begin{remark}[加速器与探测器]\\label{rem:b3:particle-physics:machines}", "\\index{对撞机}\\index{粒子探测器}", "加速粒子有两个理由：\\emph{分辨率} --- 探针看不到", "比其波长 $\\lambda = h/p$ 更精细的细节（在", "\\cref{ch:b3:crystalline-solids}中用的是埃，飞米则", "需要 \\unit{GeV} 量级的能量） --- 以及\\emph{产生}：碰撞能量", "转化为新的质量，两束粒子迎头对撞时能把它全部用上", "（固定靶则大部分能量都用于让碎片向前运动：", "见\\cref{exo:b3:particle-physics:4}）。环形对撞机让同一批粒子", "反复穿过同一个加速间隙，同时", "磁铁负责引导它们 --- 代价是同步辐射，", "其大小 $\\propto\\gamma^4$，这正是发现希格斯玻色子的那台环形装置", "对撞的是重质子，而非轻如鸿毛的电子。对撞点周围", "排列着洋葱式的分层探测器，每层回答一个问题：", "\\emph{径迹室}借磁场使带电粒子径迹弯曲（测动量）；", "电磁\\emph{量能器}吸收电子和", "光子（测能量）；强子量能器则吸收 π 介子和质子；", "只有 μ 子能穿透到最外层的探测室 ---", "依靠穿透深度的差异来鉴别粒子。中微子则以丢失动量的形式离开：", "靠守恒量的核算来探测那些什么也拦不住的粒子。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.0]", "  % quadrant onion detector", "  \\fill[omDef!10] (0,0) -- (4.7,0) arc (0:80:4.7) -- cycle;", "  \\fill[omExo!18] (0,0) -- (3.5,0) arc (0:80:3.5) -- cycle;", "  \\fill[omThm!12] (0,0) -- (2.3,0) arc (0:80:2.3) -- cycle;", "  \\fill[white] (0,0) -- (1.2,0) arc (0:80:1.2) -- cycle;", "  \\foreach \\r in {1.2,2.3,3.5,4.7} \\draw[gray] (\\r,0) arc (0:80:\\r);", "  \\draw[gray] (0,0) -- (4.7,0);", "  \\draw[gray] (0,0) -- (80:4.7);", "  % labels of layers, along the free bottom edge", "  \\node[font=\\tiny, anchor=north] at (1.75,-0.12) {径迹室};", "  \\node[font=\\tiny, anchor=north] at (2.9,-0.12) {电磁量能器};", "  \\node[font=\\tiny, anchor=north] at (4.1,-0.12) {强子量能器};", "  \\node[font=\\tiny, anchor=west] at (12:4.85) {μ 子探测室};", "  % particle tracks from origin", "  % electron: curved, stops in ecal", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (0,0) .. controls (1.1,0.62) .. (2.05,1.55);", "  \\fill[omDef] (2.6,1.9) circle (2pt);", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\tiny, anchor=south west] at (2.5,1.98) {e$^-$};", "  % photon: straight dashed (neutral), stops in ecal", "  \\draw[omDef, dashed] (0,0) -- (55:2.75);", "  \\fill[omDef] (55:2.95) circle (2pt);", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\tiny, anchor=south] at (55:3.2) {$\\gamma$};", "  % pion: curved into hadronic", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] (0,0) .. controls (0.75:2.0) and (5:2.6) .. (12:3.9);", "  \\fill[omThm] (14:4.1) circle (2pt);", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\tiny, anchor=north] at (10:4.28) {$\\pi$};", "  % muon: nearly straight, exits", "  \\draw[omExo, very thick] (0,0) .. controls (70:2.4) .. (73:5.2);", "  \\node[omExo, font=\\tiny, anchor=south] at (73:5.35) {$\\mu$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 对撞机探测器的截面图。每种粒子都留下各自的特征：", "带电径迹在径迹室的磁场中弯曲；", "电子和光子在内层量能器中被吸收，", "强子在外层量能器中被吸收；只有 μ 子能到达最远的探测室；而", "那些未被探测到的粒子 --- 中微子 --- 则由丢失的", "动量推断得出。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{remark}[希格斯与未竟之账]\\label{rem:b3:particle-physics:higgs}", "\\index{希格斯玻色子}\\index{暗物质}", "标准模型的对称性禁止其粒子具有裸质量；", "\\emph{希格斯场}充满全空间，并具有非零凝聚 ---", "即\\cref{ch:b3:phase-transitions}中的双势阱选择，", "只是把它提升到了真空本身，", "--- 打破了对称性，并通过耦合赋予粒子质量：", "粒子越重，耦合越强。它自身的量子，即希格斯", "玻色子（\\qty{125}{GeV}，2012 年发现）补全了这张表。", "未竟之账还更长：中微子在不同的味之间振荡，", "因而必须具有模型从未写入的质量", "（见\\cref{exo:b3:particle-physics:10}）；星系的旋转仿佛被", "比发光物质多五倍的物质束缚着；", "（见\\cref{ch:b3:astrophysics}）；宇宙中含有物质，", "却几乎没有反物质，这一不对称性是模型中微小的", "CP 破坏尚无法解释。这份清单就是", "接下来一切内容的大纲。", "\\end{remark}", ""]}